[ti:使一颗心免于哀伤]
[ar:知更鸟, HOYO-MiX & Chevy]
[al:崩坏星穹铁道-空气蛹 INSIDE]
[00:12.67]Birds are born with no shackles
[00:12.67]若鸟儿生来并无镣铐
[00:18.49]Then what fetters my fate?
[00:18.49]又是什么束缚我命运
[00:24.62]Blown away, the white petals
[00:24.62]洁白的花瓣被风卷去
[00:30.20]Leave me trapped in the cage
[00:30.20]留我独自受困于囚笼
[00:36.58]The endless isolation
[00:36.58]孤独无止无休
[00:39.52]Can't wear down my illusion
[00:39.52]却难以磨灭我的想象
[00:42.45]Someday, I'll make a dream unchained
[00:42.45]不如试着解开梦的枷锁吧
[00:48.75]Let my heart bravely spread the wings
[00:48.75]让我的心勇敢地振翅飞翔
[00:53.27]Soaring past the night
[00:53.27]穿过深沉的黑夜
[00:55.94]To trace the bright moonlight
[00:55.94]去追逐皎洁的月光
[01:00.98]Let the clouds heal me of the stings
[01:00.98]让云朵治愈往日的痛楚
[01:05.14]Gently wipe the sorrow off my life
[01:05.14]从生命中温柔地拭去忧伤
[01:09.60]I dream
[01:09.60]这是我的梦
[01:18.83]What is meant by "miracle"
[01:18.83]那与我无关的词汇"奇迹"
[01:24.68]A word outside my days?
[01:24.68]究竟隐藏着怎样的意义？
[01:30.80]Once again, repeat warbles
[01:30.80]我又一次重复啼啭
[01:36.28]But how could I escape?
[01:36.28]但如何才能得到解脱？
[01:42.69]No further hesitation
[01:42.69]从此不再纠结于
[01:45.50]On those unanswered questions
[01:45.50]那些没有答案的问题
[01:48.42]So now, I'll make a dream unchained
[01:48.42]现在我解开梦的枷锁
[02:01.43]Let my heart bravely spread the wings
[02:01.43]让我的心勇敢地振翅飞翔
